\"rain|strong=\"H4306\"on|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"mown|strong=\"H1488\"grass,  \nas|strong=\"H5921\"showers|strong=\"H7241\"that|strong=\"H4306\"water|strong=\"H2222\"the|strong=\"H5921\"earth.   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"In|strong=\"H3117\"his|strong=\"H3117\"days|strong=\"H3117\", the|strong=\"H3117\"righteous|strong=\"H6662\"shall|strong=\"H3117\"flourish|strong=\"H6524\",  \nand|strong=\"H3117\"abundance|strong=\"H7230\"of|strong=\"H3117\"peace|strong=\"H7965\", until|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H3117\"moon|strong=\"H3394\"is|strong=\"H3117\"no|strong=\"H1097\"more|strong=\"H7230\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"He|strong=\"H5704\"shall|strong=\"H3220\"have|strong=\"H5104\"dominion|strong=\"H7287\"also from|strong=\"H5704\"sea|strong=\"H3220\"to|strong=\"H5704\"sea|strong=\"H3220\",  \nfrom|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H5704\"River|strong=\"H5104\"to|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H5704\"ends|strong=\"H5704\"of|strong=\"H5104\"the|strong=\"H5704\"earth.   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Those who dwell in|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"wilderness|strong=\"H6728\"shall|strong=\"H6440\"bow|strong=\"H3766\"before|strong=\"H6440\"him|strong=\"H6440\".  \nHis|strong=\"H6440\"enemies shall|strong=\"H6440\"lick|strong=\"H3897\"the|strong=\"H6440\"dust|strong=\"H6083\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"The|strong=\"H7725\"kings|strong=\"H4428\"of|strong=\"H4428\"Tarshish|strong=\"H8659\"and|strong=\"H7725\"of|strong=\"H4428\"the|strong=\"H7725\"islands will|strong=\"H4428\"bring|strong=\"H7725\"tribute|strong=\"H4503\".  \nThe|strong=\"H7725\"kings|strong=\"H4428\"of|strong=\"H4428\"Sheba|strong=\"H7614\"and|strong=\"H7725\"Seba|strong=\"H5434\"shall|strong=\"H4428\"offer|strong=\"H7126\"gifts|strong=\"H4503\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Yes, all|strong=\"H3605\"kings|strong=\"H4428\"shall|strong=\"H1471\"fall down|strong=\"H7812\"before him|strong=\"H5647\".  \nAll|strong=\"H3605\"nations|strong=\"H1471\"shall|strong=\"H1471\"serve|strong=\"H5647\"him|strong=\"H5647\"